WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
PyCharm opens inside a nested child DevCapsule desktop over noVNC and loads the workspace.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Open PyCharm's integrated Terminal (Alt+F12) and run devcapsule project diagnose in in-capsule mode.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.500
Open File -> Open... from the main menu, jump to the project directory, and select capsule-diagnose-report.txt.

00:21.500 --> 00:29.250
Inspect the live in-capsule diagnostic report and the outer launcher's host-diagnose-snapshot.json side by side in PyCharm's editor.
